{"id":"2D","title":"Idols and Idolatry","part":{"n":2,"title":"Relationship to God"},"url":"/law/02-relationship-to-god/2d","entries":[{"id":"2D.1","text":"There is but one God, the LORD God the Father.","refs":[{"book":"Mark","chapter":12,"verses":"29,32"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":8,"verses":"6"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":2,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Mark 12:29, 32; 1 Cor. 8:6; 1 Tim. 2:5."},{"id":"2D.2","text":"You shall not have any other gods but the LORD God.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":20,"verses":"1-3"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":34,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":6,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":4,"verses":"10"}],"citation":"Exod. 20:1-3; Exod. 34:14; Deut 5:7; Deut 6:14; Matt. 4:10."},{"id":"2D.3","text":"You shall not engage in idolatry and worship or serve the gods, idols or graven images of other nations.","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":35,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":20,"verses":"4-59"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":17,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":17,"verses":"2-4"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":23,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":81,"verses":"9"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":10,"verses":"14"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":10,"verses":"19-20"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":5,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Gen. 35:2; Exod. 20:4-59 23; Exod. 23:24; Lev. 17:7; Lev. 19:4; Deut 17:2-4; Josh. 23:7; Psa. 81:9; 1 Cor. 10: 149 19-20; 1 John 5:2 1."},{"id":"2D.4","text":"Keep yourselves from idols.","refs":[{"book":"1 John","chapter":5,"verses":"21"}],"citation":"1 John 5:21."},{"id":"2D.5","text":"Sorrow and shame shall come to all who hasten after another god and who boast of their idols.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":16,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":97,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"Psa. 16:4; Psa. 97:7."},{"id":"2D.6","text":"are commanded to destroy all pagan idols, shrines, alters, groves, pillars, images, etc., that are in the land.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":34,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":33,"verses":"52"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":7,"verses":"5,25"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":12,"verses":"2-3"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":13,"verses":"12-17"},{"book":"Judges","chapter":2,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Judges","chapter":6,"verses":"25-28"},{"book":"2 Samuel","chapter":5,"verses":"21"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":23,"verses":"14-16"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":34,"verses":"3-7"},{"book":"Micah","chapter":5,"verses":"13-14"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:24; Exod. 34:13; Num. 33:52; Deut. 7:5,25; Deut. 12:2-3; Deut. 13:12-17; Judges 2:2; Judges 6:25-28; 2 Sam. 5:21; 2 Kings 23:14-16; 2 Chron 34:3-7; Mic. 5:13-14."},{"id":"2D.7","text":"You shall not make for yourself or erect any graven image, idol, molten god, or likeness of anything to worship.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":20,"verses":"4,23"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":34,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":26,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":4,"verses":"15-19,23-25"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"8-9"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":16,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Exod. 20:4, 23; Exod. 34:17; Lev. 19:4; Lev. 26:1; Deut. 4:15-19, 23-25; Deut. 5:8-9; Deut. 16:22."},{"id":"2D.8","text":"You shall not bring a graven image or other such abomination into your house.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":7,"verses":"26"}],"citation":"Deut 7:26."},{"id":"2D.9","text":"Graven images, idols and other pagan things to be burned with fire and the material it is made out of is not to be salvaged.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":32,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":7,"verses":"25"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":23,"verses":"4,6,11-15"}],"citation":"Exod. 32:20; Deut 7:25; 2 Kings 23:4, 6, 11-15."},{"id":"2D.10","text":"It is vanity and foolish to make and worship idols or graven images.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":115,"verses":"4-8"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":2,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":42,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":44,"verses":"9,17-19"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":10,"verses":"14-15"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":11,"verses":"12-14"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":16,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":1,"verses":"21-25"}],"citation":"Psa. 115:4- 8; Isa. 2:20; Isa. 42:17; Isa. 44:9,17-19; Jer. 10:14-15; Jer. 11:12-14; Jer. 16:20; Rom. 1:21-25."},{"id":"2D.11","text":"We are not to acknowledge the gods of heathen people by making mention of their name or by swearing by them.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":23,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:13; Josh. 23:7."},{"id":"2D.12","text":"Death penalty is to be given to idolaters.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":22,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":17,"verses":"2-5"}],"citation":"Exod. 22:20; Deut. 17:2-5."},{"id":"2D.13","text":"Those who make graven images are cursed.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":27,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Deut. 27:15."},{"id":"2D.14","text":"Do not set up idols in your heart, for it will cause you to stumble into iniquity.","refs":[{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":14,"verses":"3,4,7"}],"citation":"Ezek. 14:3, 4, 7."},{"id":"2D.15","text":"National punishment, captivity, curses and destruction for idolatry or worshiping false gods in the land.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":22,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":4,"verses":"25-27"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":8,"verses":"19-20"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":11,"verses":"16-17"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":18,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":29,"verses":"23-27"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":44,"verses":"3-6"},{"book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":5,"verses":"25-26"}],"citation":"Exod. 22:20; Deut 4:25-27; Deut 8:19-20; Deut 11:16- 17; Deut 18:20; Deut 29:23-27; Jer. 44:3-6; 1 Chron. 5:25-26."}]}